	('FND-001', 'Features', "Offline mode: caches facilities within 50 km of the user's home area", 'carried', 'afya.facilities.service:FacilityService.offline_bundle', '`offline_bundle`, at the section\'s own 50 km plus the home county its Offline note adds ("Full offline bundle for user\'s home county available on first sync") — a person near a county border has facilities in their county farther than the radius that the bundle still owes them. Served at `/facilities/offline-bundle` as `OfflineFacility` rows, nearest first.'),
